Package: pve-ibm-fs5x-fc-plugin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: pve-manager (>= 9.0), pve-manager (<< 10.0)
Recommends: patch, multipath-tools, liblwp-protocol-https-perl, libjson-perl
Maintainer: Nikita Kozlov <niakrisn@gmail.com>
Description: Proxmox VE plugin for IBM FlashSystem 5.x FC storage
 Proxmox VE storage plugin for IBM FlashSystem 5.x series storage
 arrays via Fibre Channel. Supports volume management, snapshots,
 cloning, and templates.
 .
 This package includes:
  - Storage plugin: PVE::Storage::Custom::IBMFlashSystem
  - PVE patches for proper volume activation/deactivation
  - GUI integration for web interface
 .
 This package is specific to Proxmox VE 9.x.
